      "comment": "OH SO SUPERB (1) is a newcomer for the Nathan Summers kennel. Drawn favourably and can capitalise. Respect any strong moves in the market. TRUNKEY BULL (2) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing sixth (23.87) last time in a Maiden at Richmond. Form from his last run is proving strong. Key runner on best form. CLASSY ACE (7) is a handily bred pup making his debut without a trial. Can kick off with a good run. NEED TO FLY (4) is a Kenneth Markham-trained newcomer by Bernardo out of Look I'm Flying. No favours with the draw and will need to begin well. Can run a bold race on debut.",
